  "notes": "USAGE:\nVery common in discussions about manga, anime, novels, and TV dramas. Fans eagerly discuss whether a series has {完結|かんけつ} (finished) or is still {連載中|れんさいちゅう} (currently serialized). Also used in business and project management for the conclusion of a project or process.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {完結|かんけつ}{編|へん}: final arc, concluding chapter\n- {完結|かんけつ}{済|ず}み: completed, already concluded\n- {一巻|いっかん}{完結|かんけつ}: standalone volume, self-contained\n- シリーズが{完結|かんけつ}する: a series concludes\n- {全|ぜん}〜{巻|かん}で{完結|かんけつ}: concludes in ~ volumes",
